      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Attention, attention. Stup Virus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Enfilez vos protections Stup Virus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Careful careful careful, Stup Virus, Stup Virus, put on your virus protection",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AAB",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AAB"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"couplet",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Stup Virus danger d'mort, il est la tu le sens dans ton corps",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Le truc te suinte par tous les pores, mixture à base de Doryphore",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Tu contractes des mélodies, t'as la « pied caisse-claire maladie »",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Le sample tourne c'est affolant, ce truc en boucle c'est de la folie",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Faudrait que t'en sortes, c'est commе le spliff, le truc est tеllement addictif",
          "rhyme":"if",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Musique de ouf, c'est de l'affectif, le son qui te fait tomber les tifs",
          "rhyme":"if",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Le Stup ta contaminer, le Stup Virus ta laminer",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Tu commences à éternuer, il est la pour t'éliminer",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABBCCDD",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABBBBCC"
    },
    {
